@startuml F3.8-D01-opcoes-audiencia
title F3.8-D01 — Carregar opções de audiência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CommunicationController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: /comunicacao/publicar
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /communications/audiences
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT turmas/cursos\ndo professor
note right of Ctrl
  sem broadcast
  (system.broadcast)
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: lista scoped
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 audiences
WebApp --> Prof: select pré-filtrado

@enduml
